                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} F
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/locators"} locators
                of all elements of
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi F
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} F
                is an abelian groupal setoid.
            %li
              %p
                Given two
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/abelian+groups"} abelian groups
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi G
